    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this great 3 bed, 1.5 bath semi-detached family home with sunroom extension to rear. Boasting a sunny South West facing rear garden and set in a quiet cul de sac in a very popular location.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; porch, hall, guest wc, livingroom, diningroom, sunroom, kitchen, 3 bedrooms and a shower room.\n\nLocation is ideal in a quiet cul de sac in a very popular coastal suburban setting with a host of local amenities on your doorstep including great schools, shops, supermarkets, bars & restaurants as well as a selection of sports & leisure facilities. Public transport is well catered for with both bus and train to&from Dublin City Centre. Set on the coastal walk & cycleway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 2.20m x 0.96m\nSliding door into entrance porch\n\nHall - 2.56m x 3.60m\nSpacious hallway, coving\n\nLiving Room - 3.60m x 3.30m\nOpen fire, coving, TV point, sliding doors through to ...\n\nDining Room - 3.20m x 3.90m\nCoal effect gas fire, coving, TV point, open through to ...\n\nSun Room - 3.40m x 4.10m\n2 x Velux Windows, recessed lights, French doors to rear garden\n\nKitchen - 2.56m x 2.80m\nFitted high gloss kitchen, double oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated mircowave and dishwasher, tiled floor, recessed lights, coving, sliding door to rear garden\n\nLanding - 2.10m x 3.20m\nPull down ladder to spacious attic with lights, sockets and Velux window, ideal for an attic conversion\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.60m x 3.90m\nDouble to rear, carpet, TV point, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.20m x 3.60m\nDouble to front, carpet, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.60m x 2.40m\nSingle to front, carpet.\n\nShower Room - 2.10m x 1.65m\nFully tiled, w.c., wash hand basin, electric shower, heated towel rail, recessed lights.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nPaved driveway for off-street parking, lawn, mature hedging, gated side entrance.\n\nBack Garden - \nSouth West facing. Walled. Paved patio, lawn, flower beds, block built shed with sockets, light and plumbed for washing machine.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>South West facing rear garden</li><li>Sun room extension</li><li>Off street parking to front & gated side entrance</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>uPVC double glazed windows</li><li>Good attic with potential to convert</li><li>Cul de sac</li><li>Approx. 105sqm / 1,130sqft.</ul>"
      },
